Snipe-IT asset model (paraphrased from public docs):

Asset {
  id, asset_tag, serial, name
  model_id (reference to AssetModel)
  status_id (reference to StatusLabel)
  assigned_to (user or location)
  checkout_date, expected_checkin
  purchase_cost, purchase_date
  notes, image
}

StatusLabel { id, name, type: [deployable|pending|undeployable|archived] }

AssetModel { id, name, manufacturer_id, category_id, fieldset_id }

License: AGPL-3.0

Koha circulation model (paraphrased):

Item { itemnumber, biblionumber, barcode, itemcallnumber, dateaccessioned, notforloan, damaged, itemlost, withdrawn, location }

Issue (loan) { issue_id, borrowernumber, itemnumber, date_due, branchcode, returndate, renewals, auto_renew }

Borrower { borrowernumber, categorycode, surname, firstname, email }

License: GPL-3.0
